<deviceset name="CRYSTAL_GND" prefix="Y" uservalue="yes">
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shielded SMD Crystal (case to GND)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4-pad SMD crystal where the case/shield pads are bonded to GND for EMI suppression and mechanical anchoring. Use this variant in place of the standard 2-pin CRYSTAL when you want the can grounded. Add more package sizes as new SMDxxxx-4P footprints are added to the library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.0 x 1.6mm&lt;/b&gt; - SMD2016-4P 4-pad ceramic package
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smallest commonly stocked low-cost size; ≥24 MHz only (low-frequency parts won't fit). E.g. 24/26 MHz 8-9pF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.5 x 2.0mm&lt;/b&gt; - SMD2520-4P 4-pad ceramic package
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Common compact size; ≥16 MHz typical. E.g. 16/24/26 MHz 8-12pF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.2 x 2.5mm&lt;/b&gt; - SMD3225-4P 4-pad ceramic package
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General-purpose; supports 8 MHz and up. E.g. YXC X32258MOB4SI 8MHz/12pF, LCSC C9002 family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<gates>
