&lt;li&gt;Red LED (8.8mcd, 2mA, 1.8Vf, Clear) - Low Power [Digikey: 475-2510-1-ND]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Green LED (5mcd, 2mA, 1.8Vf, Clear) - Low Power [Digikey: 475-2730-1-ND]&lt;/li&gt;
