<description>XFCN F0503-ZV-22-20T-R (LCSC C481245), 22-contact 0.5 mm vertical-entry FPC connector. Manufacturer drawing F0503-ZV-XX-20T-R, rev A0, 2010-04-12: 17.2 mm overall body width, 2.0 mm housing depth, 4.6 mm height; 0.30 mm FPC. Signals alternate between two solder rows: pad 1 lower-left, 0.5 mm projected contact pitch, 1.0 mm same-row pitch. Recommended lands 0.40 x 1.25 mm, row centers 2.25 mm apart; mechanical lands 1.80 x 2.00 mm. SUPPORT1 and SUPPORT2 are unmapped mechanical fitting nails, not cable contacts. Copper geometry cross-checked against the exact C481245 EasyEDA catalog. Keep cable/actuator access clear above the board.</description>
