<package name="QFN64_7.5X7.5_P04_EP62_LT8912B">
<description>Lontium LT8912B QFN64, 7.50 x 7.50 mm, 0.40 mm pitch. House 7 mil clearance adaptation of manufacturer TOP VIEW lands: 1.27 x 0.20 mm, 7.83 mm opposing pad-center span, 9.10 mm outer span; EP 6.20 mm. Inner land ends shortened 0.03 mm for 0.18 mm EP clearance; vendor land length is 1.30 +/- 0.05 mm. Counterclockwise: left 1-16 downward, bottom 17-32 rightward, right 33-48 upward, top 49-64 leftward. EP connects to ground. Sixteen 1.20 mm square paste apertures give 59.9% EP coverage; this stencil segmentation is an engineering choice, not a vendor drawing. Thermal vias belong in the PCB, not this package. Source: Lontium LT8912 R1.7, printed pp.22/24, PDF pp.20/22.</description>
