<devicesets>
<deviceset name="LT8912B" prefix="U" uservalue="yes">
<description>Lontium LT8912B / LCSC C2892102, single-channel MIPI DSI to HDMI/LVDS. QFN64 7.5 mm, single 1.8 V supply; CMOS pins are NOT 3.3 V tolerant. SIGNAL and POWER gates retain all 64 functional pads plus EP. Unused DSI lanes, LVDS/audio/USB functions remain real pins, not NC. RESET_N is drawn as !RESET; INT is multifunction I/O, without an inferred overbar. No DDC/HDCP. Host must provide monitor DDC separately. Pin map: LT8912B R1.13 table 6.2.1, matching LT8912 R1.7 pin-function table and Espressif ESP-HDMI-Bridge 2024-08-28. Do not use the inconsistent overview pin diagram in the old combined datasheet.</description>
<gates>
<gate name="SIGNAL" symbol="LT8912B_SIGNAL" x="0" y="0"/>
<gate name="POWER" symbol="LT8912B_POWER" x="167.64" y="0"/>
</gates>
